  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2022800,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202280000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202280000": {
          "id": 202280000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Hey there, {NICKNAME}. It's me, the \"Narrator.\"",
          "next": [
            202280001
          ]
        },
        "202280001": {
          "id": 202280001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "May I ask what kind of food you usually like? Got any recommendations for me?",
          "next": [
            202280002
          ]
        },
        "202280002": {
          "id": 202280002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Preferably nutritious food that won't break the bank.",
          "next": [
            202280003,
            202280006,
            202280009
          ]
        },
        "202280003": {
          "id": 202280003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "How about Diet Fried Rice? Smoke-free, no oil or additives. It's healthy but kind of bland.",
          "next": [
            202280004
          ]
        },
        "202280004": {
          "id": 202280004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Try some exotic snacks like Belobog Sausages and Xianzhou skewers! Guaranteed to arrive the next day with interstellar express delivery~",
          "next": [
            202280005
          ]
        },
        "202280005": {
          "id": 202280005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "But I heard shipping's not included, so I'll crunch the numbers on the procurement costs. Thanks for the rec, though.",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280006": {
          "id": 202280006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "It's hard for me to recommend... The stuff I like isn't exactly nutritious.",
          "next": [
            202280007
          ]
        },
        "202280007": {
          "id": 202280007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Skewers, combo stew, Immortal's Delight, winged burgers, cakes...",
          "next": [
            202280008
          ]
        },
        "202280008": {
          "id": 202280008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Compared to Ashen Detective's eating habits, this actually counts as a fairly balanced diet.",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280009": {
          "id": 202280009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I thought you only loved bananas.",
          "next": [
            202280010
          ]
        },
        "202280010": {
          "id": 202280010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "It's not for me. It's for Mr. Ashveil.",
          "next": [
            202280011
          ]
        },
        "202280011": {
          "id": 202280011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "What a headache... Mr. Ashveil has been eating bananas with me every single meal lately. Probably to save the hassle, or maybe to save some money.",
          "next": [
            202280012
          ]
        },
        "202280012": {
          "id": 202280012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "But without the complex nutrients humans need, his brain's just gonna get even more sluggish.",
          "next": [
            202280013
          ]
        },
        "202280013": {
          "id": 202280013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "And forgetting his phone multiple times is a clinical sign of malnutrition right there.",
          "next": [
            202280014
          ]
        },
        "202280014": {
          "id": 202280014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "So, I need to rebuild his eating habits from scratch.",
          "next": [
            202280015,
            202280016
          ]
        },
        "202280015": {
          "id": 202280015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "How do you do that? I want to manage my health too!",
          "next": [
            202280018
          ]
        },
        "202280016": {
          "id": 202280016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "What a perfect assistant helper-model!",
          "next": [
            202280017
          ]
        },
        "202280017": {
          "id": 202280017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Given how laid-back he is, I figured I'd end up handling it anyway.",
          "next": [
            202280018
          ]
        },
        "202280018": {
          "id": 202280018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "For the first few days, I mashed up his bananas and secretly mixed in other fruits.",
          "next": [
            202280019
          ]
        },
        "202280019": {
          "id": 202280019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "It turned out great. His appetite's normal, and there're no obvious signs of fight or flight response.",
          "next": [
            202280020
          ]
        },
        "202280020": {
          "id": 202280020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Next, I plan to gradually increase the ratio of new food, adding in hot meals that humans enjoy and mixing them in step by step.",
          "next": [
            202280021
          ]
        },
        "202280021": {
          "id": 202280021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "It'll be gentle on his stomach while rekindling his interest in actual human food.",
          "next": [
            202280022
          ]
        },
        "202280022": {
          "id": 202280022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "One course of treatment lasts at least seven days, or as I like to call it, the Seven-Day Diet Change Method. Works like a charm!",
          "next": [
            202280023,
            202280024
          ]
        },
        "202280023": {
          "id": 202280023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "The Seven-Day Diet Change Method. Noted!",
          "next": [
            202280026
          ]
        },
        "202280024": {
          "id": 202280024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You seem more like his master, though.",
          "next": [
            202280025
          ]
        },
        "202280025": {
          "id": 202280025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "The detective-and-assistant dynamic between us isn't going to change.",
          "next": [
            202280026
          ]
        },
        "202280026": {
          "id": 202280026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Let me see... for yesterday there were two apples, one egg, one bowl of sticky rice, one spoon of banana, and three jars of salt.",
          "next": [
            202280027
          ]
        },
        "202280027": {
          "id": 202280027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Oh, he'll be back around this time. I'd better go prep today's Apple-Banana Salted Tart.",
          "next": [
            202280028
          ]
        },
        "202280028": {
          "id": 202280028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1504,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}